{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Deckout",
    "steam_appid": 3838310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/extras/3cf4ed4980a39b2b5ec3e900010328b0.avif?t=1755700513\" width=1600 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round in Deckout plays differently. Choose the required number of cards face-down, then reveal hands in turn. Scoring happens on the spot with clear visual feedback, while a randomly chosen round rule twists the math\u2014sometimes boosting pairs or straights, other times flipping the logic entirely. When the dust settles, the lowest performer gets hammered and loses a heart. With only three hearts, tension builds fast; the last player standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/extras/a5c7c3d2d058b9178b8a96908c3e10ee.avif?t=1755700513\" width=501 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends or add smart bots that act like real players and react to what happens on the table. The whole experience is built to read at a glance so the fun never slows down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u20134 players: play with friends or fill seats with bots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret picks, sequential reveals: a quick, dramatic rhythm every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random round rules: fresh strategies each match, no two sessions alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer &amp; hearts: three hearts only\u2014fall behind and you\u2019ll feel it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy matches: designed for 5\u201310 minute bursts of competitive chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive characters and punchy audio for instant, readable feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to track your highlights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/extras/3cf4ed4980a39b2b5ec3e900010328b0.avif?t=1755700513\" width=1600 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round in Deckout plays differently. Choose the required number of cards face-down, then reveal hands in turn. Scoring happens on the spot with clear visual feedback, while a randomly chosen round rule twists the math\u2014sometimes boosting pairs or straights, other times flipping the logic entirely. When the dust settles, the lowest performer gets hammered and loses a heart. With only three hearts, tension builds fast; the last player standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/extras/a5c7c3d2d058b9178b8a96908c3e10ee.avif?t=1755700513\" width=501 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends or add smart bots that act like real players and react to what happens on the table. The whole experience is built to read at a glance so the fun never slows down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u20134 players: play with friends or fill seats with bots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret picks, sequential reveals: a quick, dramatic rhythm every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random round rules: fresh strategies each match, no two sessions alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer &amp; hearts: three hearts only\u2014fall behind and you\u2019ll feel it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy matches: designed for 5\u201310 minute bursts of competitive chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive characters and punchy audio for instant, readable feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to track your highlights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Deckout is a fast, competitive card game for 2\u20134 players. Secretly pick your cards, reveal in order, play by a random round rule, and survive the hammer\u2014each hit costs a heart. Quick rounds, big laughs, sharp decisions.",
